Ticket #4471 has been triaged. The desk's analysis groups 427 reports into **2 technical root causes**. Each has been filed as a separate GitHub issue in a public repository.

<Callout>
Two distinct problems found. GitHub tickets filed: #11 (parser, 393 reports) and #12 (hint, 34 reports).
